  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n[Merge module specifier maps](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#merge-existing-and-new-import-maps) introduced in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10528 refers to \"oldImportMap's\" without any proceeding definition to say what \"oldImportMap\" is.\r\n\r\nI also noticed that step 3.1.1.1.1.2 says \"Remove scopeImports[specifier].\", I believe this should instead be: \"Remove scopeImports[specifierKey].\"",
